---
/* ChambersStrip — prominent recognition band (Phase 3 LEGAL-07, D-35 / D-38).
   The firm's Chambers USA Spotlight 2026 badge artwork is white-on-transparent,
   so a BLACK version (/chambers-2026-dark.png, generated with sharp .negate)
   is shown directly on the normal white page (bg-bg) — D-38 dropped the earlier
   near-black band. A muted "Recognized by" kicker sits above the ~240px centered
   badge. Plain <img> served raw from /public (no astro:assets optimizer).
   Non-linked. */
---

<section data-component="ChambersStrip" class="bg-bg py-section">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-gutter">
    <p class="mb-6 text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-muted">
      Recognized by
    </p>
    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <img
        src="/chambers-2026-dark.png"
        alt="Chambers USA Spotlight 2026"
        width="240"
        height="208"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
        class="h-auto w-60"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
